    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-murray-vascular-cube-law-branching-repro-package> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Murray (1926a, 1926b), Zamir (1976) & Sherman (1981) minimum-work vascular cube law & arterial branching angles — Reproducibility package: 92/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "`self_test()` (L988-1054) executes 7 automated verification suites covering SHA-256 dataset integrity, symmetric & asymmetric angle parity, stationarity P_met/P_visc = 2.0, gamma* = 3.000 global minimum, empirical retinal junction RMSE/r, fundus image Y-junction segmentation, and two-run bitwise determinism." ;
